#: source/command-ref/files/channels.md:1
msgid "Channels"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/files/channels.md:3
msgid ""
"A directory containing symlinks to Nix channels, managed by [`nix-channel`]"
"(../../command-ref/nix-channel.md):"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/files/channels.md:5
msgid "`$XDG_STATE_HOME/nix/profiles/channels` for regular users"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/files/channels.md:6
msgid "`$NIX_STATE_DIR/profiles/per-user/root/channels` for `root`"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/files/channels.md:8
msgid ""
"[`nix-channel`](../../command-ref/nix-channel.md) uses a [profile](../../"
"command-ref/files/profiles.md) to store channels. This profile contains "
"symlinks to the contents of those channels."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/files/channels.md:11
msgid "Subscribed channels"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/files/channels.md:13
msgid "The list of subscribed channels is stored in"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/files/channels.md:15
msgid "`~/.nix-channels`"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/files/channels.md:16
msgid ""
"`$XDG_STATE_HOME/nix/channels` if [`use-xdg-base-directories`](../../command-"
"ref/conf-file.md#conf-use-xdg-base-directories) is set to `true`"
msgstr ""

